WEBVTT

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:09.540
Come on.
Somebody do something.

00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:11.910
We're definitely lacking
excitement.

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:15.330
Godai, don't you have any
funny stories to tell?

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:17.820
Like, the manager dumped you...

00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:19.950
or you got fired from
your tutoring job?

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:22.020
What's "funny" about that?!

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:26.410
Why do you always come to
my room to goof off?!

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.870
I'm sick of this!
It's unhealthy!

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:34.220
This is a sunny Sunday
afternoon!

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:37.400
At this rate, I'll just
waste away!

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:39.870
So he says.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:43.310
He thinks he's still got
a life to waste.

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:45.810
Say what you want!

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.880
Isn't there anything
interesting to do?

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:52.780
Nope. Nothin'.

00:02:53.060 --> 00:02:54.980
Hello! I'm from the
moving company!

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:57.280
The movers?

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:58.980
Coming!

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:04.220
I've been expecting you.

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:05.980
Where shall I put it?

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:09.130
It's the last room inside.
Thank you.

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:23.840
All done.

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:25.180
Thank you!

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:36.530
W-Who are these people?!

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:40.880
Don't be afraid.
They're my tenants.

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:43.660
What're you all doing out
here in your pajamas?

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:47.810
We're always like this.
Stop putting on airs.

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:49.440
This man is a visitor!

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:51.730
How nice.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:54.380
Yes... I mean, no.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:56.130
What a bunch.

00:03:56.320 --> 00:03:59.120
Godai! Look who's talking!

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:03.220
If you're like this now,
you'll waste your life away!

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:06.410
That's just what I was
worried about.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.510
He's already wasted.

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:09.310
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:11.290
Tell us, what'd ya buy?

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:12.470
A vanity mirror.

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:17.660
Nothing worth coming out for.
Please go back upstairs.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:23.730
Mirror, mirror on the wall
Who's the fairest...

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.800
Wrong kind of mirror!

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:28.670
You're wasting your
breath, Akemi.

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:31.740
Thank you for your help.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:32.950
Uh...sure.

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:41.030
That was embarrassing.

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:43.720
See ya!

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:44.720
Baseball game?

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:46.790
The finals with Clock Hill
Primary No. 2!

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:50.990
How nice and wholesome,
Kentaro.

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:53.230
I'm different from
the other tenants.

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:08.720
I'm so glad you're here,
manager.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:13.090
You and I are the only
normal ones here.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.620
Promise me you'll stay
forever and ever!

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:19.860
Sure.

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:21.030
I'm off!

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:23.010
'Bye!

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:25.800
Give it your best!

00:05:26.020 --> 00:05:28.240
Sure...it's a promise.

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:54.830
At last.

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.860
I've always wanted
a full-length mirror.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:46.540
What do you know?
My high school uniform!

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:48.350
I brought it with me.

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:53.850
Teacher!

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:55.460
Mr. Otonoshi!

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:01.030
I have questions about
today's class.

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:03.530
You come quite often
with questions.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.970
Yes, I love geology.

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:16.370
The classwork didn't
matter at all.

00:07:58.270 --> 00:07:59.960
Perfect.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:03.220
Manager!
Come drink with--

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:09.400
Manager!

00:08:18.410 --> 00:08:19.710
I, uh...

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:23.470
What do you think
you're doing?!

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:25.650
Trying it on.

00:08:26.100 --> 00:08:29.030
So that's your thing.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:31.110
It isn't that at all!

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:33.650
Please get out
while I change.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.490
Let's drink.
Just as you are.

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:46.440
W-What're you doing?!
I don't drink during the day!

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:47.770
Oh come on!

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:50.210
You'd have to be drunk
to dress that way!

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.080
Manager...you're cute!

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:57.770
I'm so embarrassed.

00:08:58.120 --> 00:08:59.920
Cute? Be right back!

00:09:00.490 --> 00:09:01.650
Where're you going?

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.190
Come on, manager,
let's party.

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:05.490
I don't want to!

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:09.460
Relax! Look how
excited Godai is.

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:10.720
Shall we go?

00:09:11.470 --> 00:09:14.020
Please...at least
let me change!

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:15.890
What if someone should
see me like this?!

00:09:15.970 --> 00:09:17.260
Nobody's coming.

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:21.710
This is turning into an
unexpectedly good weekend!

00:09:24.820 --> 00:09:25.800
Hey, everybody!

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:29.640
Whaddya think?

00:09:35.890 --> 00:09:37.060
I'm speechless.

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:39.520
Sobered me right up.

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:42.560
I'm so happy! It still
fits perfectly!

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:45.830
She was built like that
all her life.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:48.120
If she can do it...

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:49.930
Have you got a school
uniform, too?

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:54.080
Let's think of something
else to do.

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:57.900
What could be more fun?
Right?

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:01.550
Sounds okay to me.
For now.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.370
Let's drink!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:10.250
Sometimes...
We all need to cut loose.

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:18.150
What's with the robes?

00:10:20.270 --> 00:10:21.710
It's a secret.

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:29.570
That suits you.

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:30.700
Doesn't it?

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:33.070
Adults shouldn't be
horsing around like this.

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:35.210
Why not? It's Sunday.

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:37.180
You're all sick.

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.270
I agree!
This is all so--

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:41.180
Stupid?

00:10:41.720 --> 00:10:43.850
We all have to die someday.

00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:49.350
Sit down over here, Manager.

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:50.800
Godai, beer!

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:56.730
Got this from a friend who
worked at a cabaret.

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:58.400
How's it look on me?

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:00.070
Just like in the movies!

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:03.440
My goodness...

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:07.100
Isn't someone breaking
the rules?

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:10.180
There's one traitor.

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:12.140
Me?

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:16.370
You won't get away with being
the only "normal" one here!

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:20.850
Even the manager's going
along with it.

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:22.650
Don't you feel sorry
for her?

00:11:22.730 --> 00:11:25.520
If you feel sorry for me,
let me change!

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:28.300
You have your school uniform,
don't you? Go put it on!

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:30.400
You went through my closet?!

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:33.400
Why is your high school
uniform here?

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:38.200
Grandma sent it to me to wear
on my first day of cram school.

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:42.250
Such a thoughtful grandmother.

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:45.720
Put it on, Godai. You and I
can be schoolmates.

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:46.460
Schoolmates?

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:52.640
Way to go!

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:54.100
That's more like it!

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:56.060
Godai, not you, too...!

00:11:56.310 --> 00:11:57.290
Don't stop me.

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:01.520
I can't let you bear
the shame alone.

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:04.190
Good for you!

00:12:26.940 --> 00:12:29.760
Why so quiet, young lady?

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:32.620
You can confide in your nurse.

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.800
We were waiting for you!

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:38.890
My, my!

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:41.310
Come to me, student!

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:42.810
Can I come in?

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:45.790
Let's sing!

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:53.050
We look like schoolmates.

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:54.250
Y-Yes...

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:14.070
Hi, Soichiro!

00:13:28.300 --> 00:13:31.620
Nurse, hurry!
It's my face!

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:33.520
You need surgery!

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:36.750
It's really gotten
out of hand.

00:13:36.970 --> 00:13:37.930
Y-Yes...

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:39.520
Hello!

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:41.850
Someone's here.

00:13:42.310 --> 00:13:43.430
Hello!

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:45.230
It's Coach Mitaka.

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:49.000
Manager,
hurry and get the door.

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:51.770
But, I...can't.

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:53.550
Did you have a date?

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:54.970
N-No.

00:13:55.460 --> 00:13:56.290
Let's invite him in!

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:58.270
Okay, I'll do it.

00:13:58.560 --> 00:13:59.080
Hold it!

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.720
What shall I do? Shall
I have him leave?

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:03.150
Yes, please.

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:07.250
What?! Not here?

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:10.290
Really?

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:12.620
Don't you believe me?

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:13.490
Nope.

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:19.170
That's too bad. I was going
to give her your message.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.870
I don't trust you.

00:14:22.010 --> 00:14:25.370
Well, well...
Can I help you?

00:14:26.190 --> 00:14:27.400
Is there a message?

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:32.240
I was in the neighborhood,
so I dropped by.

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:36.650
What's going on here?

00:14:36.760 --> 00:14:39.020
I don't really know myself.

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:42.220
Yet you're dressed like that?!

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:44.980
Doctor! There you are!

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:47.500
Hurry, the patient needs help!

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:50.170
Doctor?!

00:14:50.470 --> 00:14:51.310
Hurry!

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.470
Missus
you must remain calm.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:55.800
I'm afraid it's already
too late.

00:14:56.140 --> 00:14:57.810
No! That can't be!

00:14:57.880 --> 00:15:01.790
The next of kin are waiting.

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:05.470
Kozo!

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:08.980
Who's Kozo?!

00:15:09.390 --> 00:15:10.010
Beats me.

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:22.310
Something's fishy.

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:29.180
Kozo!

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:35.270
Missus, you must let him go!

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:37.110
Go where?

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:38.610
You know, "there."

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:43.520
Let's trade diaries even
after we graduate.

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:48.970
Hey, you two! High schoolers
shouldn't be drinking!

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:52.360
Look at you! A coed with
a bottle of sake!

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:56.020
What?!
I'm a guidance monitor.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:59.500
Then act like one!

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:03.470
I'm a guidance monitor,
I said!

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:04.400
Stop it!

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:05.180
Let's go.

00:16:05.720 --> 00:16:06.440
What?!

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:09.770
Ignore this monitor!

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:11.000
Look out!

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:13.740
I told you, "look out."

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:16.010
Student down!

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:17.740
Let me through.

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:24.390
He died of shock from
a broken heart.

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:28.860
How sad. This humble priest
will perform his last rites.

00:16:29.450 --> 00:16:31.810
Stop that!
You'll hurt him!

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:33.710
It's okay, manager!

00:16:33.770 --> 00:16:35.570
They're just playing out
their youthful fantasies!

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:37.210
Is that what it is?

00:16:41.290 --> 00:16:41.870
Don't!

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:43.110
But it's ringing.

00:16:43.460 --> 00:16:44.820
You mustn't answer it.

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:46.610
He's right.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:48.480
It's a call from one of
your delinquent friends.

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:50.420
Don't lose heart now.

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.220
Get a grip on yourself,
Otonashi!

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:52.830
But!

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:56.930
Look what happened to
that hapless delinquent.

00:16:57.680 --> 00:17:02.190
But what if it's an emergency?
Let me answer it.

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:02.920
Stop!

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:05.260
Slap. Slap.

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:06.840
What're you doing?!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:10.400
Kyoko!!

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:16.350
Why won't you listen to
your father?!

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:18.640
Look me in the eyes
and tell me why!

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:31.000
I hope nothing's happened
to Ms. Otonashi.

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:40.630
I rule this school!

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:47.940
I've seen your true identity!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.140
Let's get out of here,
Kyoko!

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:51.850
Danger!

00:17:52.560 --> 00:17:54.080
There's danger!

00:17:54.230 --> 00:17:55.910
Stand back.

00:17:58.690 --> 00:17:59.820
There's danger here.

00:18:01.960 --> 00:18:03.390
Hey, those are...!

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:05.360
Don't give me orders!

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:06.990
My canned peaches!

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:08.570
Let me play, too!

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:13.890
Shiny peach can!

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:23.200
Blue skies, white peaches.
I'll never let you go!

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:29.590
Long lost brother,
how I've missed you!

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:42.740
M-Miss Otonashi!

00:18:49.110 --> 00:18:51.440
Godai, pass the can!

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:54.370
Drink up, Doctor.

00:18:57.950 --> 00:18:59.640
Are you all right?

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.880
Now what?

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:04.590
I don't know.

00:19:08.510 --> 00:19:10.960
Mr. Yotsuya, what was
that about?

00:19:11.170 --> 00:19:13.860
I was about to offer
a can of peaches.

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:14.960
To me?

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:18.430
To the heavens.

00:19:20.280 --> 00:19:22.540
Pass!

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:27.980
There's something I've
been wanting to say to you.

00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:30.680
Today, I'll come right out
and say it.

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:32.820
Miss Otonashi!

00:19:32.890 --> 00:19:33.490
Yes?

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:36.380
You belong in a better place.

00:19:36.460 --> 00:19:38.990
He's doing the
"young man in love" bit.

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:43.530
I can provide that place
for you.

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:48.100
That's right! You can
be a world-class player!

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:50.670
She's right, Oka!
"Aim for the Ace"!

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:52.200
Fight!

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:54.800
No!!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:58.780
I'm trying to have a serious
talk with Kyoko!

00:19:58.950 --> 00:20:01.610
Don't be fooled by his talk.
Run away with me!

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:03.650
Stay right there!

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:06.870
Head nurse! Take that patient
to the next ward!

00:20:06.950 --> 00:20:10.400
I'm operating immediately!
Start the anesthesia!

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:11.980
Right away, Doctor!

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:12.890
Yes, Father!

00:20:13.240 --> 00:20:16.830
Let me go!
I hate adults!

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:18.760
Damn you!

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:23.330
Doctor, let me go with
him to the next ward!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.630
Fine. You have my permission
to leave the hospital.

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:29.580
How about dinner on a hill
overlooking the harbor?

00:20:30.820 --> 00:20:32.930
I'm arresting you for
abuse of meal privileges!

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:35.940
How about two dozen cans of
beer and five bottles of sake?

00:20:36.030 --> 00:20:39.610
Good. I've always been
easy to bribe.

00:20:39.890 --> 00:20:40.870
Of course.

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:42.790
He was a difficult patient.

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:43.990
Really.

00:20:44.120 --> 00:20:44.950
Where's Godai?

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:46.350
Ran off.

00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:47.530
Where?

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:50.890
Into the sunset, of course.

00:20:51.070 --> 00:20:53.500
How? We're not even
near the ocean.

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:06.600
Sic him, Soichiro!

00:21:11.260 --> 00:21:22.680
A refreshing breeze!
Where are you going, clouds?

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:30.370
Mom, I'm home!
I'm hungry.

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:33.130
Mom...?

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:36.940
Drinking again?

00:21:38.590 --> 00:21:44.080
Give it to him!

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:46.200
You play foul!

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:50.590
Me?! Who used his money
to approach her?!

00:21:50.730 --> 00:21:53.060
Please!
Stop it, both of you!

00:21:53.130 --> 00:21:56.150
Let them fight.
That's what friends do.

00:22:05.410 --> 00:22:06.580
You're all right.

00:22:06.780 --> 00:22:07.800
You, too.

00:22:15.090 --> 00:22:15.850
Teacher!

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:18.940
Don't say a word. That's
what it means to be young.

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:20.380
Teacher!

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:24.350
Look there, everyone!

00:22:24.770 --> 00:22:28.420
Keep racing toward
the setting sun!

00:22:41.820 --> 00:22:43.840
Kentaro! What're you just
standing there for?

00:22:44.380 --> 00:22:46.370
Doesn't Mommy look young?

00:22:47.180 --> 00:22:49.020
Kentaro...

00:22:50.230 --> 00:22:53.250
Manager, I believed you
were the only normal one.

00:22:53.330 --> 00:22:55.370
You don't understand!
There's a reason for this!

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:58.790
The manager started it all.

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:04.100
Wait, Kentaro!
Hear me out!

00:23:04.200 --> 00:23:05.360
Kentaro!

00:23:06.130 --> 00:23:08.620
Let him go. It's part
of being young.

00:23:08.870 --> 00:23:10.630
Kentaro!!

00:23:11.520 --> 00:23:13.070
It was a super Sunday!

00:23:13.140 --> 00:23:14.480
Next time, let's do
hospital love stories!

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:16.510
Stop that!

00:23:31.100 --> 00:23:34.760
Damn! I'll run away
one day for sure!

00:23:49.770 --> 00:23:52.190
They were two friends
involved in a relationship.

00:23:52.540 --> 00:23:55.060
But one word, "love,"
threatened to ruin it all.

00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:57.890
Love is a gamble.

00:23:58.670 --> 00:24:02.740
Next: "Godai's Lost Love?
Kozue Hits on Mitaka"

00:24:02.940 --> 00:24:06.310
Godai, in a relationship, it's
how you say goodbye that counts.
